  "description": "<p><strong>Range unlimited</strong>, even across planes; one creature you know, which must be asleep or fall asleep within <strong>24 hours</strong> (the spell waits). Choose one: <strong>Converse</strong>, entering its dream for up to <strong>8 hours</strong> and showing scenes you choose; <strong>Implant</strong>, planting one command of up to 25 words, as Suggestion (<strong>Will negates</strong>; lasts until fulfilled, up to <strong>1 week</strong>); or <strong>Nightmare</strong>: <strong>Will negates</strong>; on a failure it takes <strong>6d10 psychic damage</strong>, gains 2 levels of Exhaustion (maximum 5, fading as normal) and regains no HP or spells from that rest; on a success it takes half damage and no Exhaustion.</p><p class=\"arn-note\"><strong>Classes:</strong> Illusionist</p>",
